[en.DECISION_C01_C10_NEW_EEA_REGULATION]
Demand EEA to modify its guidebook

[en.DECISION_C01_C10_NEW_EEA_REGULATION_desc]
Cozy Glow organize a private one-to-one meeting with EEA leader Chancellor Neighsay, to demand for a new amendment to the original guidebook.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C10_NEW_EEA_REGULATION]
要求教协修改指南

[zh.DECISION_C01_C10_NEW_EEA_REGULATION_desc]
和煦光流组织与教协领袖驹绝会长的私下一对一会议，要求修改教协原有指南。
